@startuml DM_HCI_Classes
title DM & HCI Classes - PythonProject4
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "DM (Data Management)" {
  class InstrumentPost {
    +id: int
    +title: str
    +brand_id: int
    +model_name: str
    +price: decimal
    +user_id: int
  }

  class User {
    +id: int
    +username: str
  }

  class Comment {
    +id: int
    +content: str
    +user_id: int
    +post_id: int
  }

  class Like {
    +id: int
    +user_id: int
    +post_id: int
  }

  class BrandInfo
  class MyInstrument
  class GenreTag

  interface PostRepositoryInterface
  interface UserRepositoryInterface
  interface CommentRepositoryInterface
  interface LikeRepositoryInterface
}

package "HCI (Presentation)" {
  class PostCreateDTO
  class PostUpdateDTO
  class CommentCreateDTO
  class UserRegisterDTO
  class UserPublicDTO
  class LikeResponseDTO
}

' relationships
User "1" <-- "*" InstrumentPost : author
InstrumentPost "1" <-- "*" Comment : comments
InstrumentPost "1" <-- "*" Like : likes

PostRepositoryInterface <|.. PostRepositoryInterface
UserRepositoryInterface <|.. UserRepositoryInterface
CommentRepositoryInterface <|.. CommentRepositoryInterface
LikeRepositoryInterface <|.. LikeRepositoryInterface

' HCI -> DM
PostCreateDTO --> InstrumentPost
PostUpdateDTO --> InstrumentPost
CommentCreateDTO --> Comment
UserRegisterDTO --> User
LikeResponseDTO --> Like

note bottom
  - DM: SQLAlchemy 모델(실제 DB 테이블)과 Repository 인터페이스
  - HCI: 요청/응답 DTOs (서버의 폼/JSON 처리 단위)
end note

@enduml
